1 General
END
+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Message Conference Areas: This list is scanned up to the word 'END'.
Lines that do not begin with a number are ignored.

Maximum: 99 Message Conferences. Un-named conferences are not
displayed for user choice. Names must not contain spaces.

Message conferences may be excluded BY NUMBER! Don't use the name of
the conference in the user's exclude list.

Beware of changing the Conference titles once messages have started!
Unlike the file libraries, the Conferences are only referenced by
number, so if you change the order, messages may be in the wrong
conference.

